---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About"
  description="About DevToolKit — a collection of free online developer tools that run entirely in your browser. Learn about our privacy-first approach."
>
  <div class="tool-page">
    <div class="tool-header">
      <h1>About DevToolKit</h1>
    </div>

    <div class="tool-info">
      <h2>Our Mission</h2>
      <p>DevToolKit was built to provide developers and everyday users with fast, reliable, and privacy-respecting online tools. We believe essential utilities should be free and accessible to everyone.</p>

      <h3>Privacy First</h3>
      <p>Every tool on DevToolKit runs entirely in your browser using JavaScript. Your data is never uploaded to any server, never stored, and never shared with anyone. What happens in your browser, stays in your browser.</p>

      <h3>Open & Free</h3>
      <p>All tools are completely free to use, with no signup, no limits, and no hidden costs. We sustain this project through non-intrusive advertising.</p>

      <h3>Fast & Reliable</h3>
      <p>Our site is hosted on Cloudflare's global edge network, ensuring lightning-fast load times regardless of your location. Tools are optimized for instant results.</p>

      <h3>Contact</h3>
      <p>Have feedback, suggestions, or found a bug? We'd love to hear from you. Reach out via our GitHub repository or email us at hello@your-domain.com.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
